    "Battery Power is battery flow. Adapter Rated Power is the adapter's capability. Adapter Input Power is measured input when available; neither is total SoC power.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Battery Power — поток энергии аккумулятора. Номинальная мощность адаптера — его возможность. Входная мощность адаптера измеряется отдельно; ни одно значение не означает общую мощность SoC."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Battery Power is battery flow. Adapter Rated Power is the adapter's capability. Adapter Input Power is measured input when available; neither is total SoC power."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery Power is signed: positive means charge, negative means discharge. System/SoC power is a separate metric.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Battery Power имеет знак: плюс означает зарядку, минус — разрядку. Мощность System/SoC — отдельная метрика."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Battery Power is signed: positive means charge, negative means discharge. System/SoC power is a separate metric."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery data source: IOKit Power Sources plus AppleSmartBattery registry details.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Источник данных: IOKit Power Sources и свойства AppleSmartBattery в IORegistry."
